    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok that makes sense. so if the risk transfers at the port of loading, does the seller still have any say in how the goods are handled once they're on the ship? like, what happens if there's a delay or something goes wrong during the voyage?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
